      "id": 1,
      "text": "Jean‑Pierre Roma, an Acadian merchant, founded what would become Montague in 1732, calling the site Trois Rivieres, now The Three Rivers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
