      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The former train station now serves as a café, gift shop and information centre overlooking the Montague River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montague%2C_Prince_Edward_Island",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A large‑scale waterfront redevelopment has transformed Montague’s riverside, adding a gallery, park and historic murals.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
